# Cline Rules for CLI Tools Project

## File Structure
- /src - Main source files
- /memory-bank - Project documentation
- /tests - Unit and integration tests
- /examples - Sample inputs/outputs

## Documentation Standards
1. All tools must include:
   - Usage instructions in README.md
   - API documentation in docstrings
   - Memory bank updates after significant changes

## Development Rules
1. Use Python 3.10+ features
2. Follow PEP 8 style guide
3. All new features require:
   - Unit tests
   - Documentation
   - Memory bank updates

## Memory Bank Requirements
1. Update after:
   - New features
   - Architecture changes
   - Significant bug fixes
2. Must include:
   - Context of changes
   - Technical decisions
   - Next steps

## Testing Requirements
1. 80%+ test coverage
2. Include edge cases
3. Document test scenarios
